The module is implemented and the constructed witnesses verify at every preset. The full gate run is now exercising 200,000 structure-aware guesses, five attacks over eight seeds, the successful Gaussian reference, and basis-change invariance; the expensive portion is the audit, not generation.
diff --git a/gen_2207_02944.py b/gen_2207_02944.py
