The family uses Theorems 4.1 and 4.7 of the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2207.02944): solvers recover a normalized rank-one isomorphism between two native Yang–Baxter constructions over \(\mathrm{GF}(p)^d\).

Local results:

